      <section className="home-emergency"><div className="wrap home-emergency-inner"><div className="home-emergency-icon"><Siren/></div><div><div className="eyebrow">EMERGO · EMERGENCY SUPPORT</div><h2>Need urgent help?</h2><p>Emergo does not call or dispatch an ambulance. Contact local emergency services directly. In India, call 112.</p></div><Link className="btn btn-light" to="/contact">Emergency and support details <ArrowRight size={15}/></Link></div></section>
